{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Jo! Been ages since we last talked. Here's something cool that happened the other day - I took Max for a walk and ran into this super nice couple who had a dog. It turns out they live close by. We decided to do doggy playdates, which is awesome considering we all need friends for our pets."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-34c9607d4f22f2f3b931cf44", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.756803+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "34c9607d4f22f2f3b931cf44", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "34c9607d4f22f2f3b931cf44", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate! Great to hear from you. Sounds like a nice encounter on your walk. Connecting with others who have pets can be uplifting and rewarding."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-0ae7de07cd82e5ae441c986e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.779500+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0ae7de07cd82e5ae441c986e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0ae7de07cd82e5ae441c986e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: It's like fate. Having a walking buddy forMax will be great. He really likes the other dog too!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-441d9b22ce1453dbc01a8039", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.789844+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "441d9b22ce1453dbc01a8039", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "441d9b22ce1453dbc01a8039", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Awesome! Did you get to know the couple very well? What were they like?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-be34073be55da9ff97ba1b6d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.801768+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "be34073be55da9ff97ba1b6d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "be34073be55da9ff97ba1b6d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: They actually didn't share a whole lot in common with me besides the love of animals, but I think that was all we needed to share in common to be good friends!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-6359c328e21c184196f03cb3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.810808+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6359c328e21c184196f03cb3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6359c328e21c184196f03cb3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That's really cool that you can just go out and meet people like that, keep it up Nate!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-3fffeef73bd2f4bbc5ecb3b9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.822806+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3fffeef73bd2f4bbc5ecb3b9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3fffeef73bd2f4bbc5ecb3b9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks! I just really enjoy watching our pets play with one another. Its like a dream come true seeing my dog so happy."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-7d41f2df3decf065d53ee40d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.833805+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d41f2df3decf065d53ee40d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d41f2df3decf065d53ee40d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I can see why having a peaceful presence around could help relieve stress. Having someone or something to come home to for a sense of calm would be helpful for relaxation."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-b95ab664d6f5ea9d543fefd6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.844806+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b95ab664d6f5ea9d543fefd6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b95ab664d6f5ea9d543fefd6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yep, Joanna. It's great! Looky here, I got this new pup for you!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-46b8dd7873532b68183671a8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.855813+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "46b8dd7873532b68183671a8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "46b8dd7873532b68183671a8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Awww! It's so cute! I love the thought Nate!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-7bd3ce942a1fc26b285d114c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.867632+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7bd3ce942a1fc26b285d114c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7bd3ce942a1fc26b285d114c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks! It's a stuffed animal to remind you of the good vibes."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-0e74ddd4f70f4d50c5fff442", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.877950+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0e74ddd4f70f4d50c5fff442", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0e74ddd4f70f4d50c5fff442", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That's so sweet! I'll cherish that little guy with all my heart!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-4a5bcd79f7e23fb1da503d5a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.889057+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a5bcd79f7e23fb1da503d5a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a5bcd79f7e23fb1da503d5a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yeah! It's like having joy in your pocket. It always makes me grin when I look at it."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-b47c53b464706d7b8b764bb4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.897563+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b47c53b464706d7b8b764bb4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b47c53b464706d7b8b764bb4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: That's great, Nate! Appreciate the small joys like that cute stuffed animal. It's a nice reminder!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-164a185c04469b66d3221a5d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.908392+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "164a185c04469b66d3221a5d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "164a185c04469b66d3221a5d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Agreed, those little things sure do make life better!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-8a9de844cf0e46ddbd029969", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.921094+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8a9de844cf0e46ddbd029969", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8a9de844cf0e46ddbd029969", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I'll always remember those moments that bring us happiness and remind us that life is great!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-66dfe18d53266ee576ce2198", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.932289+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "66dfe18d53266ee576ce2198", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "66dfe18d53266ee576ce2198", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Sure, Joanna! It's all about finding those little things and cherishing them, otherwise it's easy to get down!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-9b25a08b9259d53097ce0df5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.943695+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9b25a08b9259d53097ce0df5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9b25a08b9259d53097ce0df5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thinking back to the tough times finishing my screenplay made me realize it's those moments that bring joy and make the journey worth it."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-5e85d87e56b92617a38f76a9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.953698+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e85d87e56b92617a38f76a9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e85d87e56b92617a38f76a9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yeah, those little moments make it all worth it, especially during tough times. Enjoying the ride is key."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-742f402724852d2a7baaf96f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.963109+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "742f402724852d2a7baaf96f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "742f402724852d2a7baaf96f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Appreciating the journey and being aware of those happy moments can be a game-changer! It keeps us focused on our dreams. Can't wait to show it to you. I value your opinion!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-1e4fd98c8dc10b2a24edcd4b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.977697+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1e4fd98c8dc10b2a24edcd4b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1e4fd98c8dc10b2a24edcd4b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Can't wait to see it, Joanna! I'm here to support you."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-a81e4f4f16d6e83073b9330b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:38.991613+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a81e4f4f16d6e83073b9330b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a81e4f4f16d6e83073b9330b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks, Nate! Your support is greatly appreciated. I'll make sure to keep you updated."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-ae75cc987029e072002db05c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:39.003402+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ae75cc987029e072002db05c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ae75cc987029e072002db05c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: No worries! You've got this. Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-verified-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_13-5f49d5a01596dc00d4558e8b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:29:39.012405+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5f49d5a01596dc00d4558e8b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5f49d5a01596dc00d4558e8b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
